@*
===========================================================
ORANGE TENDER MANAGEMENT SYSTEM
PAGE: Fingerprint Registration & Login

DEVELOPER OWNER: Ahmad
MODULE: Authentication & Biometrics
TRELLO TASK: Fingerprint Registration & Login
TRELLO URL: https://trello.com/c/mQphpvOG

PURPOSE:
Enrollment page for fingerprint sign-in; the sign-in entry
point is on the Login page.

BUSINESS ACCESS:
Any signed-in user (enrolls their own account)

ROUTE: /Biometrics/Fingerprint

FUTURE IMPLEMENTATION:
- Decide and document the fingerprint verification approach.
- Store only credential metadata (would need a migration).
- Enable the Login page button when the flow works; audit
  enrollments.

DEPENDENCIES:
AspNetUsers, future biometric credential table, Login page,
AuditLogs.

STATUS:
UI SCAFFOLD ONLY — BUSINESS LOGIC NOT IMPLEMENTED.

IMPORTANT:
Do not fake fingerprint verification, store fingerprints, or
add login bypasses.
